<%#
  CZID-285 -- Layer 3 export-screening start page.

  Approval model (legal-approved 2026-08-24): clearance is attestation + denied-party screening, with NO
  document identity-verification step. This page hands off to the screen.

  TODO(counsel): ALL user-facing copy here is a PLACEHOLDER with legal weight and MUST be drafted or
  approved by counsel before go-live (design doc S10). Do not treat the text below as final.

  Minimal, dependency-free skeleton (no React/webpack entry) so the gate is functional now.
%>
<div class="export-control-clearance" style="max-width: 720px; margin: 64px auto; padding: 0 24px; font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
    <%# TODO(counsel): heading copy %>
    Export-control screening required
  </h1>

  <div style="background:#f6f8fa; border:1px solid #d0d7de; border-radius:6px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px; line-height:1.6;">
    <p><strong>PLACEHOLDER -- pending counsel-approved text (TODO(counsel)).</strong></p>
    <p>
      Access to export-controlled data and functions on this service requires that you be screened against
      U.S. denied- and restricted-party lists. To proceed, your account will be screened before access is
      granted.
    </p>
    <p>
      [The exact language, the applicable screening lists, and the handling of a screening result are
      counsel-owned and will replace this placeholder before enforcement is enabled.]
    </p>
  </div>

  <%= form_with url: export_control_clearances_path, method: :post, local: true do %>
    <p style="color:#57606a; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:20px;">
      Clearance version: <%= @clearance_version %>
    </p>

    <%#
      This synchronous submit runs the screen and records the outcome. With the reference stub it records a
      PENDING clearance and the gate keeps the user out (deny), which is the correct dark-mode behavior.
    %>
    <button type="submit"
            style="background:#0969da; color:#fff; border:none; border-radius:6px; padding:10px 20px; font-size:15px; cursor:pointer;">
      <%# TODO(counsel): button label %>
      Continue
    </button>
  <% end %>
</div>
